#: src/postulo/plugins/listing_search/__init__.py
msgid "Search a job service from Listings when you press for it, and review an advert you choose as any capture is reviewed. One request per press, carrying the words, the place and the filters searched for and nothing about the person, to the service's own address, which so learns what somebody here is looking for. Each service has its own switch. Off until an administrator switches it on; switched off, nothing is asked and nothing already kept is touched."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/listing_search/__init__.py
msgid "Which job services Listing search can search, and how each one's answer is read: Platsbanken, Arbetsförmedlingen's adverts (Sweden), asked at jobsearch.api.jobtechdev.se with no key, its adverts under CC0. Nothing here asks anything by itself."
msgstr ""
